# QTP-Rust

Copyright (c) 2026 Xiaowei Jia

This project is a Rust reimplementation of the QTP quantitative trading core.
Its order-book implementation and historical golden test expectations are based
on the original QTP project, which is licensed under the GNU Lesser General
Public License version 3. The standalone C++ test oracle has been removed;
the reviewed golden expectations remain in the Rust regression tests.

